#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:119
msgid ""
"The model virtualenv settings pin the validated backend versions: "
"``sentence-transformers[image]==6.1.0`` with ``transformers==5.20.0`` for"
" Sentence Transformers, ``transformers==5.20.0`` for native Transformers,"
" and ``vllm==0.32.0`` with ``transformers==5.19.0`` for vLLM. Use "
"separate virtual environments for these backends. Model virtualenv "
"settings install their respective dependencies automatically."
msgstr ""
"La configuración de los entornos virtuales del modelo fija las versiones "
"de los backends que se han validado. Usa ``sentence-"
"transformers[image]==6.1.0`` con ``transformers==5.20.0`` para Sentence "
"Transformers, ``transformers==5.20.0`` para el backend nativo de "
"Transformers y ``vllm==0.32.0`` con ``transformers==5.19.0`` para vLLM. "
"Usa un entorno virtual distinto para cada backend. La configuración de "
"los entornos virtuales del modelo instala automáticamente las "
"dependencias correspondientes."

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:126
msgid ""
"Hugging Face uses ``nvidia/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-BF16`` at revision "
"``main``; ModelScope uses ``nv-community/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-BF16`` at"
" revision ``master``. Select the download hub with ``--download_hub "
"huggingface`` or ``--download_hub modelscope`` when launching."
msgstr ""
"Hugging Face usa ``nvidia/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-BF16`` en la revisión "
"``main``. ModelScope usa ``nv-community/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-BF16`` en "
"la revisión ``master``. Al iniciar el modelo, selecciona la fuente de "
"descarga con ``--download_hub huggingface`` o ``--download_hub "
"modelscope``."

